{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "version": 2,
  "framework": null,
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": ".",
  "functions": {
    "api/chat.js": {
      "runtime": "nodejs20.x",
      "maxDuration": 60,
      "memory": 512
    }
  },
  "headers": [
    {
      "comment": "静态资源：内容指纹在查询串里，可以长缓存。注意 app.js/app.css 的 URL 带 ?v=<hash>。",
      "source": "/(app.js|app.css|manifest.json)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=300, s-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800" }]
    },
    {
      "comment": "课程内容文件：改动时会变指纹，但保守起见用较短缓存。",
      "source": "/content/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=300, s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400" },
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "入口 HTML 必须不缓存，否则学习者会长期停留在旧版本。",
      "source": "/index.html",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" },
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "no-referrer" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "全站安全响应头。注意：CSP 里 connect-src 允许 https: 是为了让 AI 代理可部署在任意 Vercel 域名；若你有固定域名请收紧。",
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "Permissions-Policy", "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()" },
        {
          "key": "Strict-Transport-Security",
          "value": "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload"
        },
        {
          "key": "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy",
          "value": "same-origin"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "AI 代理的响应头：禁止被嵌入、禁止缓存（含用户提问）。",
      "source": "/api/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-store, max-age=0" },
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "no-referrer" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": false
}
